{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号标题首先吸引视线，紫色强调词“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”最突出；随后容易注意到下方另一句大号标题“这念头让他一阵心慌”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他在犹豫要不要回去，似乎舍不得过去被当作自己人的感觉。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、孤独、心慌。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他究竟是怀念曾经的归属感，还是害怕孤独到愿意重新忍受过去的委屈，两种动机之间的区别需要读完整句才能明确。中间段落还补充了重新面对过去的自己、问题仍没有简单答案等信息。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题单块较长，包含两种不同的回去动机及其关系，需要读完整句才能理解。\",\n    \"上方主标题和下方同样醒目的大字都在表达核心信息，视线需要在两块之间切换。\",\n    \"放大的紫色词组虽然醒目，但单独看不足以交代完整处境和两种动机的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "922bb971-b504-476a-ae30-12e45cafc859", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013025873492Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:31:06.580171+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64fb97661616afb4d829ed37b4c778c55102a6eadce2871ff9062ffd57804fdd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f